		(uuid "7476595f-179b-551e-8dff-e1511466eba3")
	)	(text "ADR-044a (operator directive 2026-10-07): F33 pin 1 VCC is provisioned for the MODULE MAXIMUM DRAW (1118 mA @ 5.5 V = 6.15 W DC) and is fed from the RAW supercap node (VSCAP, post-BAT54, PRE-LDO) through the ADR-029 D8 pin-1 selector J_VCC. It is NEVER fed through the TPS7A02 (<=300 mA vs 1118 mA = hard failure). Local bulk C_BULK + C_HF, clamp D_CLAMP, rail monitor R_MON1/R_MON2/C_MON -> IO13. Full +33 dBm needs >=5.0 V rail; +30 dBm needs >=3.54 V interpolated (ADR-044 S8 table). Firmware must gate TX on the LOADED rail."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 24.13 0)
		(effects
