	)	(text "TODO(unverified) OPEN-15 SUPERCAP CELL ESR + COLD BANK BEHAVIOUR -- ADR-044a 3/4: the AVX SCC 3.3 F 2.7 V cell's ESR is NOT in this repository, at 25 C or at -60 C. Every rail-step number in ADR-044a is conditional on the assumed 0.10 Ohm/cell. ADR-029 5 test 4 (<20 mV rail dip during a worst-case burst) is NOT met by scaling this cell family: 16.7 mOhm would need ~12 cells in parallel per series position."
